# .github — org profile
File: .github/README.oot

GitHub org files for openOODA. Public home board:
`docs/HOME.oot`. Live site: https://openooda.org.

This repo is not a product sidebar item. The brand link on
the site loads `docs/HOME.oot`.

```
curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install.sh | bash
```

